# Lint before complete

Before considering any code change finished:

1. Run `npm run lint` (or `pnpm lint`) from the repo root.
2. Fix all reported lint errors and re-run until clean.
3. Do not report the task as done while lint fails.

Also run typecheck (`npx tsc --noEmit`) when the change touches TypeScript types, schemas, or public APIs.
